				<wikidot:authorName>RNGF</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1805273</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Dr. Gears: Not in a traditional sense. To use a mathematical example, he started with the solution, and worked backwards to create the problem. The multiple containment failures, the evacuation of items, SCP-083 and its attacks on site staff, all these stretched the resources of Site 19 to a dangerously thin level. This allowed him to achieve what I hypothesize to be his true goal.</p> <p>Interviewer: …which would be?</p> <p>Dr. Gears: To ride SCP-682.</p> </blockquote> <p>Perfect.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
